#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/perl-deps/perl-net-ssleay.xml:58
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of Net::SSLeay"
msgstr "Instalação do Net::SSLeay"

#.  https://github.com/radiator-software/p5-net-ssleay/issues/511
#.  https://rt.cpan.org/Public/Bug/Display.html?id=12954
#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><note><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/perl-deps/perl-net-ssleay.xml:63
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"One test named <filename>32_x509_get_cert_info.t</filename> is known to fail"
" with OpenSSL-3.4.0 or later.  If enabling the external tests, one test in "
"t/external/15_altnames.t may fail."
msgstr ""
"Um teste chamado <filename>32_x509_get_cert_info.t</filename> é conhecido "
"por falhar com OpenSSL-3.4.0 ou posterior. Se habilitar os testes externos, "
"um teste em t/external/15_altnames.t possivelmente falhe."

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><para><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/perl-deps/perl-net-ssleay.xml:74
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>yes '' | perl Makefile.PL &amp;&amp;\n"
"make                      &amp;&amp;\n"
"make test || true</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>yes '' | perl Makefile.PL &amp;&amp;\n"
"make                      &amp;&amp;\n"
"make test || true</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><para><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/perl-deps/perl-net-ssleay.xml:80
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>make install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>make install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/perl-deps/perl-net-ssleay.xml:71
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"This module uses a variant of the standard build and installation "
"instructions: <placeholder type=\"screen\" id=\"0\"/> Now, as the "
"<systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user: <placeholder "
"type=\"screen\" id=\"1\"/>"
msgstr ""
"Esse módulo usa uma variante das instruções padrão de construção e "
"instalação: <placeholder type=\"screen\" id=\"0\"/> Agora, como o(a) "
"usuário(a) <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>: <placeholder "
"type=\"screen\" id=\"1\"/>"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/perl-deps/perl-net-ssleay.xml:87
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/perl-deps/perl-net-ssleay.xml:90
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<command>yes ''</command>: Perl will ask if you wish to run external tests, "
"which will fail if you do not have network connectivity. The default is 'n',"
" specifying this allows you to script the build."
msgstr ""
"<command>yes ''</command>: \"Perl\" perguntará se você deseja executar "
"testes externos, que falharão se você não tiver conectividade de rede de "
"intercomunicação. O padrão é \"n\"; especificar isso permite que você "
"automatize a construção."

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/perl-deps/perl-net-ssleay.xml:96
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<command>|| true</command>: When running a script which exits on error, this"
" prevents stopping because of the known test failure."
msgstr ""
"<command>|| true</command>: Ao executar um conjunto de comandos sequenciais "
"que sai em caso de erro, isso evita a parada devido à falha conhecida de "
"teste."

